00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:52.240
villain in Age of Ultron and ultimately becomes an&nbsp;
Avenger, and then got her own show. So she's very,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:56.800
very briefly a villain, right? She's working with&nbsp;
Ultron to destroy the Avengers. Wanda and her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:04.960
