Pietro is killed in battle, but obviously we get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:15.280
great ramifications of that, which means we&nbsp;
get Elizabeth Olson in the rest of the MCU,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:21.200
